# Deployed (Static Web App) build config. Loaded by `vite build` in its default
# `production` mode, so `azd deploy web` (which runs `npm run build`) picks it up
# automatically for every azd environment.
#
# Only static, secret-free values live here: the API is reached through the SWA's
# linked APIM backend at a relative path, so no host, key, subscription id, or
# tenant id is needed (see ui/src/util/api.js — the APIM subscription key is
# optional and intentionally omitted for the linked-backend path).
#
# The one per-environment value, VITE_AZURE_MAPS_CLIENT_ID, is written to
# ui/.env.production.local at deploy time by the `web` prebuild hook in
# azure.yaml, sourced from the Bicep output of the same name.
VITE_API_URL=/api/haste/
VITE_STORAGE_APIM_URL=/api/haste/storage/get-artifacts
VITE_PROJECT_STORAGE_APIM_URL=/api/haste/storage/get-project-artifacts
